Mon Oct 26 11:16:39 UTC 2026 - Tomáš Chvátal <tomas.chvatal@gmail.com>

- Replace the one-letter Summary ("X") with the package's actual
  description text
- Drop the deprecated Group: tag
- Convert the xkeyboard-config BuildRequires to pkgconfig form
  (resolves to the same package) and use %{_fontsdir}; spec-cleaner
  canonical pass
- Suppress the dir-or-file-outside-snapshot error in the package
  rpmlintrc: this package is not compatible with transactional
  (frozen) update systems - it ships pre-generated libX11 compose
  caches in /var/cache/libx11/compose, a directory compiled into
  libX11 that cannot be relocated from this package, and the
  content-hashed cache must persist across snapshots/rollbacks
  rather than roll back with the system; the finding is not
  actionable from this package

